            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Historically, it's rare for commercial payers to have drug formularies for medical benefits, but that's changing. In effect, health plans are, in some ways, choosing drugs they prefer, based on their judgments about safety and efficacy, as well as availability, lowest net cost, and how a drug is administered.</AbstractText>
